{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>[Time Sticker]: A Healing Idle Game Where Time Becomes a Reward</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling tense from fast-paced games? Try this lightweight idle game that &quot;trades time for joy&quot;. \u2014 Once you open the game, an exquisite clock starts ticking quietly. All you need to do is let it stay by your side, automatically accumulating points every second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn Points by Idling</strong>: No operations required \u2014 the clock automatically generates points every second, even when running in the background;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087410/extras/d53a80a19e4cf945e01fe81f77672695.poster.avif?t=1764098389\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087410/extras/d53a80a19e4cf945e01fe81f77672695.webm?t=1764098389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Packs</strong>: Use points to buy &quot;Sticker Packs&quot; and &quot;Dial Packs&quot; \u2014 each type holds unique surprises;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087410/extras/4d0507dec0f83e3950df9baac4f6d7f8.avif?t=1764098389\" width=400 height=550 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rare Items</strong>: Nearly a hundred stickers and dials are waiting for you to collect,  from minimalist to gorgeous special effects, to create your one-of-a-kind dream clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragra